{
    "about": "Shapes drawn from a path in a 100 by 100 box and fitted to the item. Read by the canvas (composables/shapes.ts) and by the server (App\\Support\\Board\\Shapes), so a shape an MCP client names is the one the canvas draws. path: the outline, filled with the item's fill and drawn in its line. solid: parts filled in the line's colour. noFill: lines only. hit 'box': the whole box takes the pointer. insets: how far inside the box the outline lies at the middle of a side, as a share of it, for a connector to stop on. flat: the sides that are straight edges of the box. text: how far in from each side the label's box starts, as a share of the item -- more than 1 or less than 0 puts the label outside it. defaults: what a new one starts with. rows: 'table' or 'class' -- it holds a list of rows (composables/rows.ts) under a titled band. header: it has a titled band of a fixed depth along its top. slide: a connector's end dropped on it keeps how far along it it was dropped. designs: other ways to draw a kind, chosen by an item's \"variant\" -- 'more' lists drawings of its own (path, solid, and shade: parts filled a little darker than the fill, for depth), and 'icon' (one of lib/icons.json) adds three drawn with it: a card with the icon over its label, a badge (the icon on a disc) and the icon alone, the label under the last two.",
